Package: ConfSets
Type: Package
Title: Confidence Sets for Functional ICC in Test-Retest Studies
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given = "Mohammad Reza", family = "Seydi",
      email = "mohammad.seydi@umu.se",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0002-3278-5554")
    )
  )
Description: This package constructs confidence sets for the intraclass correlation coefficient (ICC) of functional (curve) data in a test-retest setting.
  The confidence sets can be expressed as an ICC curve with confidence bands or as an integrated ICC with a confidence interval.
